  "body": [
    "Meet the Atelier",
    "The first Fréscopa machine with a feel for your mornings. It learns what you love, softens or sharpens to match your mood, and quietly takes care of the rest. Barista craft, kept warm by a little intelligence.",
    "Meet your coffee agent →",
    "Fuel, meet a machine that gets it",
    "Over a semester of early lectures and late-night study sessions, the Atelier learns exactly how you take your coffee — then makes it that way without you lifting a finger. No app to set up, no dials to learn. Just a cup that fits your day, whether that's a 9am seminar or a 2am essay crunch.",
    "See how it learns →",
    "How it learns you",
    "Every cup teaches the Atelier a little more: how strong, how sweet, how you like your mornings to feel. We call the picture it builds your flavour DNA. Watch it shift as the day, and your mood, changes.",
    "Brisk and a little bolder. Enough to meet the day, never so much it rushes you.",
    "Mood-aware brewing",
    "A packed Monday, an early flight, a slow Sunday with nowhere to be. The Atelier looks at what's ahead and adjusts, so the cup in your hand always suits the morning you're actually having.",
    "Tap a day to see what it would pour.",
    "A full day ahead, so a bolder, quicker cup to meet it.",
    "This week, for you",
    "A short list worth trying, drawn from what you already love and where you might like to wander. Coffee, tea, and cold-pressed juice, all in the same trusted hands.",
    "Coffee The house pour Our everyday blend, coaxed a little rounder for the season. The one you'll reach for on autopilot. $14Add to cart →",
    "Our everyday blend, coaxed a little rounder for the season. The one you'll reach for on autopilot.",
    "Tea Honeybush & orange peel Caffeine-free, and quietly sweet. Made for the afternoons that ask you to slow down a little. $11Add to cart →",
    "Caffeine-free, and quietly sweet. Made for the afternoons that ask you to slow down a little.",
    "Juice Cold-pressed citrus Three oranges, one grapefruit, and a whisper of ginger. Bright enough to wake a room. $8Add to cart →",
    "Three oranges, one grapefruit, and a whisper of ginger. Bright enough to wake a room.",
    "Kind by design",
    "The Atelier keeps an eye on your beans and reorders before you run low, in packaging that returns to the earth as easily as it arrived. It even bags the spent grounds, ready for the garden.",
    "Compostable pods",
    "Plastic-free refills",
    "Reorders itself",
    "Grounds for your garden",
    "From kitchens like yours",
    "“It worked out that my Monday needs more than my Sunday. I never taught it that. It simply knew.” Mara · Lisbon",
    "“It worked out that my Monday needs more than my Sunday. I never taught it that. It simply knew.”",
    "Mara · Lisbon",
    "“The first machine I've owned that feels less like a gadget and more like a habit.” Devon · Melbourne",
    "“The first machine I've owned that feels less like a gadget and more like a habit.”",
    "Devon · Melbourne",
    "“I haven't run out of beans since it arrived. A small thing that quietly changed my week.” Priya · Bristol",
    "“I haven't run out of beans since it arrived. A small thing that quietly changed my week.”",
    "Priya · Bristol",
    "Come say hello",
    "Part shop, part studio, part living room. Pull up a stool, taste a few blends, and let one of ours show you what your mornings could feel like.",
    "Find a café near you →",
    "Your best cup is the one you haven't met yet.",
    "Bring the Atelier home, and let tomorrow's coffee introduce itself.",
    "Meet your coffee agent → Order the Atelier"
  ],
